# The topic from 332 on join, who set it from 333, a change and a clear
# with TOPIC, and 331 (Ergo's answer to TOPIC when none is set).
! welcome
< :irc.test 005 textual CHANTYPES=# :are supported by this server
< :textual!~u@h JOIN #t2
> MODE #t2
< :irc.test 332 textual #t2 :hello world
? topic #t2 hello world
? line #t2 Topic is hello world
< :irc.test 333 textual #t2 carol!~u@5aftjv5fggq76.irc 1793900949
? line #t2 Set by carol on *
< :carol!c@h TOPIC #t2 :new topic
? topic #t2 new topic
? line #t2 carol changed the topic to new topic
< :carol!c@h TOPIC #t2 :
? topic #t2 none
? line #t2 carol changed the topic to*
< :carol!c@h TOPIC #t2 :back
< :irc.test 331 textual #t2 :No topic is set
? topic #t2 none
? line console #t2 No topic is set
? registered textual
